# Root .env — shared secret reference for the monorepo (loader + screener).
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. This file is gitignored; `.env.example` is tracked.
#
# mise does NOT auto-load .env — export these into your shell before running
# `wrangler r2 sql query` or the loader tools, or source .env manually.

# --- R2 SQL / Data Catalog (read) ---------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare API token with R2 SQL Read on the lake bucket. Same token under
# two names, consumed by different tools:
#   R2_SQL_TOKEN              → screener Worker secret (worker/.dev.vars)
#   WRANGLER_R2_SQL_AUTH_TOKEN → `wrangler r2 sql query` (loader validation)
R2_SQL_TOKEN=
WRANGLER_R2_SQL_AUTH_TOKEN=

# Non-secret lake connection values (also set as Worker vars in worker/wrangler.jsonc):
#   R2_SQL_ACCOUNT_ID=3315bb3e7d2e3556bfea6fb3947a890e
#   R2_SQL_BUCKET=cboe-options-data
